{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2025-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1738368000, "end_date": 1738972799, "month_true_total": 136, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:54:46 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "187413627", "author": {"steamid": "76561198200595379", "personaname": "dmcode", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dm-cr/", "num_games_owned": 164, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1976, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1435, "last_played": 1739727676, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Super fun game", "timestamp_created": 1738964698, "timestamp_updated": 1738964698, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187410295", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049834840", "personaname": "that_guy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198049834840/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3701, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3308, "last_played": 1767132653, "avatar": "1c420d178f66d4691b32a82a49ec20a7825e74d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Roboquest is a roguelite FPS that I strongly recommended if you're a casual looking for something more challenging. \r\n\r\nThe whole game is designed from top to bottom to just be fun: a Saturday morning cartoon aesthetic, heart-pumping EDM music, a fairly low skill floor for a movement heavy shooter, classes that are distinctive yet easy to pickup and a Borderlands-esque handling of guns all come together to make this game fun.\r\n\r\nA design choice I strongly appreciate is how the weapons, most items and perks are available from the get go, ensuring decent variety across playthroughs.\r\n\r\nDespite being a roguelite, there's no random level generation which is presumably to facilitate the various location and secret based unlocks as well as the constant high speed the game expects you to be at.\r\n\r\nMy main gripe is that some of the aforementioned unlocks are borderline mandatory for higher difficulty play and accessing certain classes, not to mention how getting some unlocks essentially go against the high mobility game play that's expected. Those are all small and personal issues though, I still strongly recommend this game.", "timestamp_created": 1738961526, "timestamp_updated": 1738961526, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187395074", "author": {"steamid": "76561199027234632", "personaname": "TitoTyme", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199027234632/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 19339, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3140, "playtime_at_review": 7517, "last_played": 1790888374, "avatar": "44184e4ce717036331ca85b615aad7eda5add3b9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome game, if you enjoy fps this is for you for sure.", "timestamp_created": 1738947729, "timestamp_updated": 1738947729, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187341039", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051000320", "personaname": "Brunão", "persona_status": "offline